[resource]
script = ExtResource("1")
id = &"dread_winter_day"
; Dread under a winter day (L18-11, the ch1 wolf hunt): the light doesn't go,
; the world goes still. It darkens little (L18-14: exposure 0.8 against the
; day's 0.85; the old 0.56 left the frame dark and the fix lit the centre
; instead, which blew the snow out). A low iron overcast, colour drained to almost nothing,
; the fog closing in so the treeline melts into white murk and every trunk is a
; black bar against it. The overcast sky and the snow are the light: a cold
; flat key from above and a pale bounce from below, so the doe and the wolf
; read while the woods round the clearing stay grey and blind.
